'''Hevnoraak''' is one of eight named [[Skyrim:Dragon Priest|dragon priests]] found in Skyrim. He is found in [[Skyrim:Valthume|Valthume]], and is the subject of the quest [[Skyrim:Evil in Waiting|Evil in Waiting]]. [[Skyrim:Hevnoraak (item)|His eponymous mask]] can only be obtained when he is dead. This mask grants immunity to all types of poisons and diseases, except for those which ignore poison and disease resistance. He carries a [[Skyrim:Hevnoraak's Staff|unique staff]] that creates a [[Skyrim:Wall of Storms|wall of lightning]].

Hevnoraak knows the following spells: [[Skyrim:Chain Lightning|Chain Lightning]], [[Skyrim:Command Daedra|Command Daedra]], [[Skyrim:Conjure Storm Atronach|Conjure Storm Atronach]], [[Skyrim:Greater Ward|Greater Ward]], [[Skyrim:Ebonyflesh|Ebonyflesh]], [[Skyrim:Lightning Cloak|Lightning Cloak]], and [[Skyrim:Thunderbolt|Thunderbolt]].
